  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La Municipalidad de Maullín implementará un moderno sistema de televigilancia en el Estadio Municipal José Montealegre Mücke para resguardar la primera final regional de clubes ANFA entre General Baquedano y Comercio de Castro.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">El operativo contempla:</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📹\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t5f/1/16/1f4f9.png\"/> Cámaras de alta definición al exterior y una cámara 360°, al interior</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🖥️\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t81/1/16/1f5a5.png\"/> Monitoreo en tiempo real desde una central de vigilancia, instalada en el recinto .</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👮\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tbb/1/16/1f46e.png\"/> Patrullajes mixtos entre Seguridad Pública Municipal y Carabineros.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🚓\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/te8/1/16/1f693.png\"/> Refuerzo de los servicios policiales antes, durante y después del encuentro.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Además, La Mayor comisario de Carabineros de Maullin Pamela Sandoval recordó que estará prohibido el ingreso de bebidas alcohólicas, fuegos artificiales y elementos contundentes, haciendo un llamado a vivir esta histórica jornada como una verdadera fiesta familiar.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente: munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12262\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/yihw7f59m3x9hvc/estadio_01_1_1024x683_wxth3fgeo8.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-49 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12266\" data-id=\"12266\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/sujgasusbguup2c/estadio_02_1_1024x683_o18rvus3fv.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12268\" data-id=\"12268\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/lec0rcdfwjz04xw/estadio_04_1024x683_0nimunp3n1.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12264\" data-id=\"12264\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/agdjwo6sv46n6py/estadio_05_1024x683_25grskxhqv.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12265\" data-id=\"12265\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/z1ky3o9hgdhpctv/estadio_07_1024x683_8366jyo8z3.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n</figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12263\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/j8e4qtk8a0brsg6/estadio_06_1024x683_d8cs9y7s5e.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12267\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/5uowh6c29x8ugs5/estadio_03_1_1024x683_nq48fws780.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>"
